---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = 'About Air Fryer Converter';
const description =
	'Learn how this oven to air fryer conversion tool works—plus how our oven to air fryer conversion calculator and chart help you cook faster with confidence.';
const canonical = 'https://airfryerconverter.com/about-us/';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>
	<main class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-10 md:py-14">
		<section class="bg-canvas-soft rounded-3xl border border-hairline p-6 md:p-10">
			<h1 class="font-display text-display-xl tracking-[-2.4px] text-ink">About Air Fryer Converter</h1>

			<p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm text-body leading-7">
				Air Fryer Converter is built to help home cooks turn oven recipes into air fryer results with less guesswork. If you’ve
				ever wondered how to apply an oven to air fryer conversion to your favorite meals—especially when translating
				conventional cooking temperatures and oven times—you’re in the right place.
			</p>

			<h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-display-md tracking-[-0.96px] text-ink">Our Mission</h2>
			<p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm text-body leading-7">
				Our mission is simple: make oven to air fryer conversion clear, repeatable, and accessible. We focus on practical
				guidance using an oven to air fryer conversion calculator and a conversion chart mindset so you can start with a trusted
				baseline, then adjust using doneness cues.
			</p>

			<h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-display-md tracking-[-0.96px] text-ink">Why We Built This Tool</h2>
			<p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm text-body leading-7">
				Air fryers can cook differently than conventional ovens. Heat circulation, browning speed, and cook time all change
				how food comes out. That’s why “copy the recipe exactly” often fails. We built this tool to help you convert
				a regular oven recipe into air fryer settings without constantly searching for new oven temperature conversion rules.
				Whether you need an oven to air fryer conversion chart, a quick answer in Celsius, or help understanding what’s going on
				when air fryer temperatures run lower, we designed the experience around cooking confidence.
			</p>

			<h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-display-md tracking-[-0.96px] text-ink">How Oven to Air Fryer Conversion Works</h2>
			<p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm text-body leading-7">
				Oven to air fryer conversion usually follows a baseline approach: reduce the oven temperature and reduce the cooking time.
				The exact adjustments can vary by food type, thickness, and your specific fryer, but the logic stays consistent. The oven to
				air fryer conversion calculator provides instant starting values, while the oven to air fryer conversion chart style guidance helps
				you understand how to plan your cook before you press start.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm text-body leading-7">
				From there, doneness beats the clock. We encourage you to check browning early, monitor texture, and make small time
				adjustments as needed—so your results stay close to the original recipe’s intent.
			p>

			<h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-display-md tracking-[-0.96px] text-ink">Who This Website Helps</h2>
			<p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm text-body leading-7">
				This site is for cooks who want a faster path from “oven recipe” to “air fryer result.” It’s useful for:
			</p>
			<ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 max-w-3xl text-sm text-body leading-7">
				<li>People converting conventional oven favorites into air fryer versions</li>
				<li>Anyone searching for an oven to air fryer conversion chart to start quickly</li>
				<li>Home cooks needing help with oven temperature conversion for air fryer cooking in Celsius and Fahrenheit</li>
				<li>Busy households scaling recipes and switching appliances</li>
			</ul>

			<h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-display-md tracking-[-0.96px] text-ink">Accuracy &amp; Disclaimer</h2>
			<p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm text-body leading-7">
				Our guidance is designed to be practical and helpful, but no conversion method can guarantee identical outcomes across every
				fryer, model, batch size, and recipe. Cooking results depend on ingredients, moisture, temperature accuracy, and your
				air fryer’s airflow. Always verify doneness and use safe food handling practices. The tool provides starting points—not
				a substitute for food safety guidelines.
			</p>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
